An attribute line inside a footnote body attaches inside it

```
[^a]: note

  {.cls}
  styled

see[^a]
.
<p>see<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>note</p>
      <p class="cls">styled<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```
